 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Massajiya No Elf Wa Mimi Ga Yoi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "マッサージ屋のエルフは耳が良い"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Elf at the Massage Parlor Has Great Ears"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the quiet suburbs lies a humble massage shop, run by an elf named Yutaka. Despite being unable to speak, Yutaka possesses a unique ability—exceptionally sharp hearing. Whether it’s easing physical tension or addressing deeper concerns, his extraordinary skill allows him to listen beyond words and resolve his clients troubles. The shop attracts a variety of peculiar customers, each carrying their own burdens and quirks. Through his gentle demeanor and unparalleled expertise, Yutaka creates a serene, almost magical atmosphere where people can find solace. This is a heartwarming, slice-of-life story about the daily interactions between a thoughtful elf masseur and his unusual patrons in a hidden oasis of calm. An enchanting glimpse into an elf’s unique working life."
  },
